414	== V41__claim_reminded.sql
415	-- An OPEN or PENDING claim can be reminded, once per sheet's today: the last sheet's today a reminder was written
416	-- (null: never reminded). Kept in the claim's history too (see V39). The journal trigger is made again around the
417	-- change: altering the table copies it, and a trigger left on would keep naming the copy's history.
